{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/984237-demon-the-fallen-lore-question","id":984237,"title":"Demon the Fallen Lore Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-08T21:44:49-07:00","id":984237,"title":"Demon the Fallen Lore Question","content":"i want to make a fallen who has lores relating to ice and freezing- (A slayer who collected that which had frozen to death) what are my options? is there a lore path that deals with this or will i need to homebrew? I also notice that Demons dont seem to think electricity is useful outside thunderstorms seems a necessary area to learn for the modern age","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>there are no bad ideas, just ideas that have not been refined enough","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1608-iamthesweeper","name":"IAmTheSweeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T09:50:32-07:00","id":984471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IAmTheSweeper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/984237-demon-the-fallen-lore-question#post984237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i want to make a fallen who has lores relating to ice and freezing- (A slayer who collected that which had frozen to death) what are my options? is there a lore path that deals with this or will i need to homebrew? I also notice that Demons dont seem to think electricity is useful outside thunderstorms seems a necessary area to learn for the modern age</div> </div> </div> </div>There aren't any lores for those things specifically. What I found was that common lores were severely lacking so I started making my own to flesh em out. You might do the same with Electricity or Ice house specific if that feels more appropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2456-zeroninja","name":"zeroninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T01:44:11-07:00","id":984787,"title":"","content":"as zeroninja said there is no lore that does specifically that but for the ice and freezing thing I'd take a look at the Lore of the Winds and the Lore of Storms. I think a lot of their evocations could quite easily be re-fluffed for freezing effects, especially when you combine using it with the Lore of Death.<br /> I think the Lore of the Winds especially could work well for that.<br /> <br /> For example:<br /> lvl1 Summon Wind: in the high torment version the wind doesn't reek of death and decay but is freezing cold instead<br /> lvl2 fist of air: the lethal damage comes from freezing effects<br /> <br /> and so on<br /> <br /> similar things could be done to the Lore of Death quite easily without changing much on the mechanical side of things (if at all).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}